'''Frostbite''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Frostbite Item Pack]] for 1,699 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Frostbite's handle is a black colored grip which is attached to two shiny silver guards. One of the silver guards is attached to ice. The blade of the knife is black in color, and it's stamped into sharp frozen ice.

==Trivia ==
*It was one of the four [[Godly Weapons|godly]] weapons released during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]], the others being [[Minty]], [[Lugercane]] and [[Eternalcane]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].

